---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
  <Base title="我的账户 · 宇海VPN" description="查看宇海VPN 账户、当前套餐和到期时间。可以领取试用、输入兑换码，或用 USDT 购买月卡、季卡和年卡。">
  <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <meta slot="head" name="yuhai-api" content="https://api.yhvpn.io" />
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="kicker">用户中心</span>
      <h1>我的账户</h1>
      <p>查看套餐和设备。可以领取试用、输入兑换码，或用 USDT 购买在售套餐。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap account-wrap">
      <p class="account-loading" id="account-loading">正在读取账户…</p>
      <div class="account-gate" id="account-gate" hidden>
        <h2>请先登录</h2>
        <p>登录后可以查看套餐、到期时间和设备数。</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/login/">去登录</a>
      </div>
      <div id="account-panel" hidden>
        <div class="account-grid">
          <article class="account-stat">
            <span>账号</span>
            <b class="mono" id="acc-address">—</b>
          </article>
          <article class="account-stat">
            <span>当前套餐</span>
            <b id="acc-plan">—</b>
          </article>
          <article class="account-stat">
            <span>到期时间</span>
            <b id="acc-expire">—</b>
          </article>
          <article class="account-stat">
            <span>设备数</span>
            <b id="acc-devices">—</b>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="account-actions">
          <article class="box-card">
            <h3>24 小时免费试用</h3>
            <p id="trial-copy">新账户可以领取一次。不限流量，最多 3 台设备，到期即停，不会自动变成付费。</p>
            <p class="form-error" id="trial-error" hidden></p>
            <p class="form-ok" id="trial-ok" hidden></p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" id="trial-claim" type="button">领取 24 小时免费试用</button>
          </article>
          <article class="box-card">
            <h3>兑换码开通</h3>
            <p>输入兑换码后按卡面天数开通。</p>
            <form id="redeem-form" method="post" action="/account/" novalidate>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="redeem-code">兑换码</label>
                <input class="mono" id="redeem-code" name="code" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="64" placeholder="例如 ABCD-EFGH-JKLM-NPQR" />
              </div>
              <p class="form-error" id="redeem-error" hidden></p>
              <p class="form-ok" id="redeem-ok" hidden></p>
              <button class="btn btn-outline" id="redeem-submit" type="submit">开通</button>
            </form>
          </article>
        </div>
        <article class="box-card buy-card" id="buy-card">
          <h3>购买套餐</h3>
          <p>使用 TRON 网络的 USDT（TRC20）。到账数量必须和下面的金额完全一致，两位尾数用来认出是你的付款。</p>
          <div id="plan-list" class="plan-list"></div>
          <p class="form-error" id="buy-error" hidden></p>
          <div id="pay-panel" hidden>
            <p class="pay-kicker">到账数量必须等于</p>
            <p class="pay-amount" id="pay-amount"></p>
            <p class="pay-note">请勿四舍五入。从交易所提币时，到账数量要等于这个数，手续费另计。转错网络无法找回。</p>
            <div id="pay-qr"></div>
            <p class="mono pay-address" id="pay-address"></p>
            <p id="pay-countdown"></p>
            <p id="pay-status"></p>
            <p class="form-ok" id="pay-ok" hidden></p>
            <div class="pay-actions">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" id="pay-copy-amount" type="button">复制金额</button>
              <button class="btn btn-outline" id="pay-copy-address" type="button">复制地址</button>
              <button class="btn btn-outline" id="pay-cancel" type="button">取消订单</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <div class="account-foot">
          <span>连接请使用<a href="/download/">安卓或 Windows 客户端</a>，用同样的地址和密码登录。</span>
          <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" id="logout" type="button">退出登录</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script is:inline src="/assets/web-account.js"></script>
</Base>
